  "description": "Clean Architecture template — Infrastructure.Auditing sub-package: Audit.NET wiring (AddAuditNet, Serilog sink), the EF Core change-capture interceptor (AuditNetEfInterceptor), recursive PII masking (AuditFieldMasker — Audit:MaskedFields tokens + [PersonalData] matched by simple type name), and the IAuditEventMaskContributor / IAuditMaskingPrimitives seams consumed by SU2.C15e.Web.Defaults. Zero SU2.C15e.* project dependencies — reference it standalone from a host that needs audit masking without EF/Dapper. Numeronym `C15e` = CleanArchitecture. Generation 2026 series. See docs/plans/infrastructure-persistence-package-split-redesign.md.",
